    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fields of Mine</strong> is a roguelike built on classic Minesweeper \u2014 but with twists that reward sharp eyes and smart choices.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/77fea9e1dbf24dd1082a5103d2298e9a.avif?t=1748979791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a branching map where each field is a puzzle. Some grids are altered by tricky effects: flipped numbers, hidden clues, extra mines, timed bombs, or trap tiles that trigger chain reactions. Before each boss, there's a moment to breathe \u2014 but after that, things only get harder.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/7c0c89ccbaf05e697b2fb4a5b832e450.avif?t=1748979791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden tickets to spend in shops and gain upgrades: fewer mines, extra lives, shields, auto-flags or bonus safe reveals. The deeper you go, the harder it gets \u2014 but every mistake is a lesson. And if you fall short, you can always start fresh.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/9a7539edd5fce64ce200cab795976301.avif?t=1748979791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fields of Mine</strong> is a roguelike built on classic Minesweeper \u2014 but with twists that reward sharp eyes and smart choices.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/77fea9e1dbf24dd1082a5103d2298e9a.avif?t=1748979791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a branching map where each field is a puzzle. Some grids are altered by tricky effects: flipped numbers, hidden clues, extra mines, timed bombs, or trap tiles that trigger chain reactions. Before each boss, there's a moment to breathe \u2014 but after that, things only get harder.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/7c0c89ccbaf05e697b2fb4a5b832e450.avif?t=1748979791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden tickets to spend in shops and gain upgrades: fewer mines, extra lives, shields, auto-flags or bonus safe reveals. The deeper you go, the harder it gets \u2014 but every mistake is a lesson. And if you fall short, you can always start fresh.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/9a7539edd5fce64ce200cab795976301.avif?t=1748979791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Minesweeper meets roguelike: upgrades, traps, bosses and a branching map where every field is a tactical challenge.",
